<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1521', padding: 60 }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 20, background: '#63A7D4' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FBCE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>从炼油厂到 AI 工厂</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 14 }}>AI 不止是聊天机器人，它渗透进一切学科</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#3A4653', marginTop: 18 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, marginTop: 22, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 560, borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Image src="assets/ai_factory.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: '100%', padding: 14, background: 'linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(6,14,26,0.9) 0%, rgba(6,14,26,0) 100%)' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9CFE7' }}>"过去是检索式的，今天是生成式的。"——黄仁勋</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 8, background: '#1E3D5C', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#63A7D4' }}>01</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>为什么要"工厂"</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9CCCE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>你用 Grok，每次结果都不同。实时生成的内容，必须在全世界就近产出。</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 8, background: '#1E3D5C', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#63A7D4' }}>02</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Omniverse：物理正确的世界</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9CCCE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>机器人在遵守物理定律的虚拟环境里学习，再迁移到真机。</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 8, background: '#1E3D5C', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#63A7D4' }}>03</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>被渗透的学科</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9CCCE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>化学、蛋白质、基因、物理、流体力学、粒子——以及机器人。</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#162534', borderRadius: 6, padding: 14, borderLeft: '3px solid #8ED1A8' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>英伟达与沙特 Humain 合作，把 Omniverse 用于数字工厂、机器人与仓储。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#63A7D4', borderRadius: 6, padding: 15, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#08131F' }}>结论：</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#08131F' }}>当算力成为基础设施，AI 工厂就是新时代的炼油厂。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
